#{\footnote # options_menu}${\footnote $ Options Menu Commands}K{\footnote K Options menu;Low Priority;Medium Priority;High Priority;Alert Always;Flash if Inactive;Ignore if Inactive}+{\footnote + commands:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Options Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Low Priority}\tab Printing takes little time from other programs.\par
{\b Medium Priority}\tab Printing and other programs share the time.\par
{\b High Priority}\tab Printing takes more of the time.\par
{\b Alert Always}\tab Messages from Print Manager show at once.\par
{\b Flash if Inactive}\tab Print Manager's icon or title flashes for a message.\par
{\b Ignore if Inactive}\tab Messages wait until Print Manager is active.\par
\page
#{\footnote # view_menu}${\footnote $ View Menu Commands}K{\footnote K View menu;Time/Date Sent;Print File Size;Exit}+{\footnote + commands:020}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 View Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Time/Date Sent}\tab Shows when each file was sent.\par
{\b Print File Size}\tab Shows each file's size.\par
{\b Exit}\tab Ends Print Manager after the files waiting are printed.\par
\page
